<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela bolivar closes firm at 473.75/474.75/dlr.</title>
<headline>Venezuela bolivar closes firm at 473.75/474.75/dlr.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Venezuelan bolivar closed firm in slow trade at 473.75/474.75 per dollar as Central Bank dollar sales shored up the unit, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;The Bank took the dollar down, even though there was only little demand, but it was intervening to keep the bolivar at a fixed level,&quot; said one trader</p>
<p>The bolivar closed Friday at 474.00/475.25 per dollar</p>
<p>((-- Ana Isabel Martinez, Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
</text>
